<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">You &amp;amp; Me</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Catra and Adora often discuss aspects of their past life during the Horde: they share many good memories and some not so good. For Catra, growing up in the Horde with her best friend was also a confusing time for her, mainly because she started to have strong feelings for Adora and wasn't sure what they meant... turned out she was in love with Adora. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This series explores eight moments in Catra's and Adora past that lead up to the start of my fic: Together at the End of the World. All chapters are written from Catra's POV to match the theme of that these prequel chapters link with.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>Midnight_Owl2</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
